cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and this repository."
title: "UnDetect: predicting transcriptional responses to unseen compounds"
abstract: >-
  UnDetect predicts the transcriptional response to a compound that was never profiled in any cell line, from a
  drug-free context backbone on the paired control profile and a multi-view compound kernel over structure,
  targets, mechanism of action and Cell Painting morphology. This repository holds the code of the paper, its
  Pixi environments, a Snakemake demo pipeline and a Quarto report.
